OL,3,GNEWSASwimmer Archie Goodburn thanks
OL,4,Aprime minister as brain cancer review
OL,5,Aannounced
OL,6,
OL,7,FSwimmer Archie Goodburn has been
OL,8,Fsuccessful in his efforts to improve
OL,9,Fbrain cancer care for patients as the
OL,10,FUK government announce new measures.
OL,12,FThe Scottish athlete, who was diagnosed
OL,13,Fwith three inoperable brain tumours two
OL,14,Fyears ago, met Prime Minister Andy
OL,15,FBurnham after making a tearful TV
OL,16,Fappeal for more investment to be put
OL,17,Finto brain cancer research.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
